	affiliations = {Open University of the Netherlands, Heerlen, Netherlands; University of Melbourne, Parkville, Australia; Maastricht University, Maastricht, Netherlands; MSB Medical School Berlin, Berlin, Germany; The University of Auckland, Auckland, New Zealand; King Faisal Specialist Hospital and Research Centre, Riyadh, Saudi Arabia; Addis Ababa University, Addis Ababa, Ethiopia; University of Otago, Dunedin, New Zealand; Universitas Indonesia, Depok, Indonesia; Cerrehpaşa University Faculty of Medicine, İstanbul, Turkey; Queen’s University Belfast, Belfast, United Kingdom; University of Nottingham, Nottingham, United Kingdom; Universidade Federal de Rondonópolis, Rondonópolis, Brazil; University of Gloucestershire, Cheltenham, United Kingdom; University of Padua, Padova, Italy; Université libre de Bruxelles, Bruxelles, Belgium; University of Antwerp, Antwerp, Belgium; Airlangga University, Surabaya, Indonesia; Avedis Donabedian Research Institute (FAD), Barcelona, Spain; Universitat Autònoma de Barcelona (UAB), Barcelona, Spain; Avaluació de tecnologies sanitàries en atenció primària i salut mental (PRISMA), Institut de Recerca Sant Joan de Déu (IRSJD), Esplugues de Llobregat, Spain; Consortium “Centro de Investigación Biomédica en Red” Epidemiology and Public Health (CIBERESP), Madrid, Spain; Universidade de Lisboa, Lisboa, Portugal; University of Manchester, Manchester, United Kingdom; Instituto Superior Técnico, Lisbon, Portugal; SAST - Segurança e Saúde do Trabalho, São Bernardo do Campo, Brazil; University Savoie Mont Blanc, Chambéry, France; University of Toronto, Toronto, Canada; Universidade Católica Portuguesa, Lisboa, Portugal; University of Limerick, Limerick, Ireland; Istanbul Technical University, İstanbul, Turkey; LeefstijlLab Arnhem, Arnhem, Netherlands; Radboud University Medical Centre, Nijmegen, Netherlands; University of Bern, Bern, Switzerland; Cyprus University of Technology, Limassol, Cyprus; University College London, London, United Kingd